    <div id="pnlDesirableQualifications" class="jcBand">
	
        <h3 class="postingHeader">Desirable Qualifications</h3>
        <div class="postingContent">
            In addition to evaluating each candidate's relative ability, as demonstrated by quality and breadth of experience, the following factors will provide the basis for competitively evaluating each candidate:
        </div>
        <div class="postingContent">
            <ul><li>Database design and modeling.</li><li>NET software lifecycle design, development, &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;installation, integration, evaluation, enhancement, maintenance, and testing.</li><li>Building Application Programming Interfaces (API) and/or API gateways and RESTful Web Services.</li><li>Developing in various Cloud Environments (public cloud, private cloud, hybrid cloud).</li><li>Business Intelligence (BI) solutions development in collaboration with business customers and other technical&nbsp; main experts using Microsoft or other reporting and analysis software.</li><li>Microsoft SQL Server database administration.</li><li>Microsoft SQL Server databases, capacity planning, performance tuning, backup/restore, troubleshooting, and maintaining high availability in complex environments and mission critical applications.</li><li>Creating scripts using VB Script, Batch Language, and Microsoft PowerShell.</li><li>Building/deploying/maintaining and supporting SSIS packages and SSRS reports.</li><li>Building/deploying SQL jobs, including database maintenance packages.</li><li>Microsoft SQL Server DBA hands-on skills in supporting a production databases in all operations, such as troubleshooting daily operational issues.</li><li>Complex data analysis and integration using Microsoft SSIS.</li><li>Writing SQL with complex joins, stored procedures, and database functions</li><li>C# programming.</li><li>Data extraction from SQL and IBM Db2 databases.</li><li>Planning, designing and implementing data models, DataMart, and data warehouses.</li><li>ETL tools and processes.</li><li>Integrating and extracting relevant information &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from large amounts of structured and unstructured data (internal and external) to enable analytical solutions.</li><li>Manipulating large data sets through statistical software (ex. Software as a Service (SaaS)) or other methods.<br /></li></ul>
        </div>
    
</div>

    

